      "username": "drkrash1969",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/d/eada6e/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2020-06-16T18:38:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>They dream big...and sometimes bigger than their resources can manage.&nbsp; I think there was a better chance of seeing lots of books 6 years ago before they became a much larger game company.&nbsp; Now they seem in constant danger of overextension.</p>\n<p>If we see one book a year, I think we should count ourselves lucky.</p>",
