      "raw": "<p>They dream big...and sometimes bigger than their resources can manage.&nbsp; I think there was a better chance of seeing lots of books 6 years ago before they became a much larger game company.&nbsp; Now they seem in constant danger of overextension.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>If we see one book a year, I think we should count ourselves lucky.</p>",
