      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/d/eada6e/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2020-06-16T23:32:59.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I agree with you.&nbsp; I'd just prefer to see two books a year, rather than one.&nbsp; As it is now, they have announced 3-4 books (I think?).&nbsp; At one a year, they'll barely get those out before either people will have moved on to the new hotness.</p>",
