      "id": 231153,
      "name": "Sea-Envy",
      "username": "Sea-Envy",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/sea-envy/{size}/1849_2.png",
      "created_at": "2020-06-17T09:52:16.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>For reference, the promised book from the kickstarter are-</p>\n<p>Dimand book/Zzzwhat’s his name- mystic/cosmic horror adventures and probable GM advise</p>\n<p>Tie in adventure for the Sentinels of Freedom computer game- Possibly stats for The Adhesivist, Since the main bad guys for chapter 1 are already stated, On the Letters Page Christopher implied that the background and synopsis was almost as many pages as the adventure</p>\n<p>Guise book- Guise, weird niche hero allies and enemies, GM advise, Wager Master, probably new character options</p>\n<p>Dark Watch- The team, ©Rook City, The organization, For Profit villain team, New character options, possibly optional rule sets, GM advise</p>\n<p>Urban Settings- Setting information, new rules, GM advise</p>\n<p>A Prime Wardens book and a Space/Void Guard book are the “not guaranteed by Kickstarter”  books Christopher and Adam talk about most<br>\nA Master Archive and Time Period specific Archives have also been mentioned, as has a Magic meta-power source/setting/theme book</p>\n<p>The Paradigms and The Order of The Simple Machine also need a home but they could be in the Urban book.</p>",
