      "raw": "For reference, the promised book from the kickstarter are-\r\n\r\nDimand book/Zzzwhat's his name- mystic/cosmic horror adventures and probable GM advise\r\n\r\nTie in adventure for the Sentinels of Freedom computer game- Possibly stats for The Adhesivist, Since the main bad guys for chapter 1 are already stated, On the Letters Page Christopher implied that the background and synopsis was almost as many pages as the adventure\r\n\r\nGuise book- Guise, weird niche hero allies and enemies, GM advise, Wager Master, probably new character options\r\n\r\nDark Watch- The team, (C)Rook City, The organization, For Profit villain team, New character options, possibly optional rule sets, GM advise\r\n\r\nUrban Settings- Setting information, new rules, GM advise \r\n\r\n\r\nA Prime Wardens book and a Space/Void Guard book are the \"not guaranteed by Kickstarter\"  books Christopher and Adam talk about most\r\nA Master Archive and Time Period specific Archives have also been mentioned, as has a Magic meta-power source/setting/theme book\r\n\r\nThe Paradigms and The Order of The Simple Machine also need a home but they could be in the Urban book.",
